AcceptanceCriteria.Criterion:
Each of these nine exits 0, run as the command text
named, not via bun run validate:ci. Read each exit
from the command, never through a pipe
(cmd >out 2>err; echo $?). The nine:
bun run typecheck;
bun run test;
bun run validate:cli;
bun run ./scripts/validate-marketplace.ts;
bun run validate:examples;
bun run validate:determinism;
bun run validate:packed;
bun run validate:schema-reference;
bun run validate:skeleton-templates.
Omit only bun run validate:teaching-surface, and name
why: sibling C-LINT-PHASE-HONESTY-2 is a spec new
skeleton that names neither README.md nor examples/
(scripts/check-teaching-surface.ts:237
checkDocsAndExamplesDecision). That is ordered, not
deferred. Filling that sibling is not this bundle.
Do not put a current-mode lint of this project root
in this task's Verification; AC-CLOSE-LINT is
CloseEvidence, post-archive only, owned by the
authority.
